.TH CALL-DUCKERCTL 1 "August 2026" "CallDucker 0.1.1"
.SH NAME
call-duckerctl \- inspect and control CallDucker
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B call-duckerctl
.I COMMAND
.SH COMMANDS
.BR status " [" --json "]"
Print daemon status.
.TP
.B list-apps
List audio applications known to the daemon.
.TP
.B preview
Start a five-second preview.
.TP
.B restore
Restore saved volumes immediately and pause until the active call ends.
.TP
.BR enable | disable
Change the setting and systemd user service state.
